# Ruling 2015-06-22: "that hasn't been chosen" refers only to that specific Demonic Pact, whoever chose them. Bot1's Pact
# chooses its damage mode on turn 3 (Bot2 16, Bot1 24); Bot1 then gives the Pact to Bot2 with Harmless Offering. At Bot2's
# upkeep the Pact triggers for Bot2, who may not choose the damage mode (`! Bot2.Modes(1)`) and draws two instead.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Demonic Pact
Harmless Offering
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

